A NOTE ON THE DATA THIS TOOL PRODUCES

The Software reads DNS records that domain owners publish to the public
Domain Name System. It performs ordinary recursive DNS queries and nothing
else — it does not scrape web pages, execute JavaScript, bypass access
controls, or access any non-public system.

Users of the Software remain responsible for their own conduct, including
query volume and rate limiting against third-party resolvers, and for
compliance with any applicable law governing the collection, storage,
publication or onward use of information about the organizations they scan.

For permission requests, contact the copyright holder via
https://github.com/junxit
